<Mod id="92859491-293a-4b58-818f-92147183d17e" version="1">
  <Properties>
    <Name>Bohemia (CYH)</Name>
    <Description>Introduces Bohemia to Civilization VI under Jan Zizka. [NEWLINE][NEWLINE] Civ Ability - The Defenestrations of Prague: Unlock Forts earlier, and they give Production and Faith. Units on Forts or near Wagon Forts gain bonus strength, and melee units near Forts push enemies back after attacking. [NEWLINE][NEWLINE]  Leader Ability - Glorious Ride: Gain strength attacking enemies on unfavorable terrain, and gain defensive strength defending on favorable terrain. Gets Great Prophet points on military kills and Great General points on religious kills. [NEWLINE][NEWLINE]Unique Unit  - Wagon Fort: Provides defensive strength to nearby units. [NEWLINE][NEWLINE]Unique District - Royal Mint: Commercial Hub replacement that grants and gains bonus Gold with Mines, and gives Diplomatic Favor on buildings within it.</Description>
    <Created>1763174686</Created>
    <Teaser>Introduces Bohemia to Civilization VI.</Teaser>
    <Authors>clapyourhands</Authors>
    <AffectsSavedGames>0</AffectsSavedGames>
    <CompatibleVersions>1.2,2.0</CompatibleVersions>
  </Properties>
